ng/claude-code-source\">ximing/claude-code-source</a>，用两周时间拆解完这 51 万行源码，系列全文在 GitHub 仓库的 <a href=\"https://github.com/ximing/claude-code-source/tree/main/articles\"><code class=\"language-text\">articles/</code></a> 目录下：</p>\n<p><strong>核心循环与工具</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ximing/claude-code-source/blob/main/articles/01-bootstrap-and-architecture.md\">启动链路与整体架构——51 万行源码怎么组织</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ximing/claude-code-source/blob/main/articles/02-agent-loop.md\">Agent 主循环——queryLoop 状态机</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ximing/claude-code-source/blob/main/articles/03-streaming-and-api-client.md\">流式协议与 API 客户端——边生成边执行</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ximing/claude-code-source/blob/main/articles/04-tool-system.md\">工具系统架构——注册、调度与并发</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ximing/claude-code-source/blob/main/articles/05-bash-tool-security.md\">Bash 工具的三层防线</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ximing/claude-code-source/blob/main/articles/06-file-and-search-tools.md\">文件与搜索工具——为什么是 grep 而不是向量索引</a></li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>上下文与记忆</strong></p>\n<ol start=\"7\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ximing/claude-code-source/blob/main/articles/07-system-prompt-assembly.md\">系统提示词装配流水线</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ximing/claude-code-source/blob/main/articles/08-prompt-caching-and-cost.md\">提示缓存与成本工程</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ximing/claude-code-source/blob/main/articles/09-context-compaction.md\">上下文压缩体系——五层压缩策略</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ximing/claude-code-source/blob/main/articles/10-memory-system.md\">记忆系统——文件记忆、自动提取与”做梦”整理</a></li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>安全与扩展</strong></p>\n<ol start=\"11\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ximing/claude-code-source/blob/main/articles/11-permission-pipeline.md\">权限决策管线</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ximing/claude-code-source/blob/main/articles/12-sandbox-and-egress-proxy.md\">沙箱与容器出口代理</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ximing/claude-code-source/blob/main/articles/13-mcp-client.md\">MCP 客户端——连接、OAuth 与工具命名空间</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ximing/claude-code-source/blob/main/articles/14-skills-progressive-disclosure.md\">Skills——渐进式披露的实现</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ximing/claude-code-source/blob/main/articles/15-subagent-and-multi-agent.md\">Subagent 与多 Agent 体系</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ximing/claude-code-source/blob/main/articles/16-hooks-engine.md\">Hooks 引擎——5022 行的用户扩展点</a></li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>持久化、交互与收官</strong></p>\n<ol start=\"17\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ximing/claude-code-source/blob/main/articles/17-session-storage-and-resume.md\">会话持久化与恢复</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ximing/claude-code-source/blob/main/articles/18-tui-rendering.md\">TUI 渲染与交互层——重度 fork 的 Ink</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ximing/claude-code-source/blob/main/articles/19-tasks-and-automation.md\">任务系统与自动化</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ximing/claude-code-source/blob/main/articles/20-hidden-surface.md\">隐藏面——feature flag、彩蛋与对抗设计</a></li>\n</ol>\n<p>如果只在 Agent 系列里挑几篇对照着读：<a href=\"../2025/03-25-%E6%8B%86%E8%A7%A3CodingAgent/\">拆解 Coding Agent</a> 对应第 2、6 篇，<a href=\"../2025/01-28-%E9%95%BF%E4%BB%BB%E5%8A%A1%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%B1%E5%BF%86%E4%B8%8E%E5%AF%B9%E7%AD%96/\">长任务的失忆与对策</a> 对应第 9 篇，<a href=\"../2025/11-04-%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%E6%8C%89%E9%9C%80%E5%8A%A0%E8%BD%BD/\">能力按需加载</a> 对应第 14 篇，[多 Agent 协作的真实收益与代价](../2025/11-25-多 Agent 协作的真实收益与代价/) 对应第 15 篇——概念和实现互相印证。</p>","fields":{"slug":"/post/2026/04-13-ClaudeCode源码拆解系列/"},"tableOfContents":"<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#claude-code-%E6%BA%90%E7%A0%81%E6%8B%86%E8%A7%A3%E7%B3%BB%E5%88%9720-%E7%AF%87%E7%B4%A2%E5%BC%95\">Claude Code 源码拆解系列：20 篇索引</a></li>\n</ul>","frontmatter":{"title":"Claude Code 源码拆解系列：20 篇索引","date":"2026年04月13日","description":"Claude Code 泄露源码的 20 篇深度拆解索引，覆盖 Agent 主循环、工具系统、上下文压缩、记忆、权限、沙箱、MCP、Skills、多 Agent 等完整技术面。","tags":["AICoding","源码分析"]},"wordC